<title>SPAIN: IBCA upgrades Spain's BCH rating to &quot;B/C&quot;.</title>
<headline>IBCA upgrades Spain's BCH rating to &quot;B/C&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European ratings agency, has upgraded its individual rating for Spain's Banco Central Hispano to &quot;B/C&quot; from &quot;C&quot;, an IBCA spokesman said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
